+   * keeps its longest option's width) and is no wider than its container (a box in a column that sizes to its content,
+   * as the uploader's drop zone does, otherwise takes the option's width), so a long option never pushes a page past a
+   * phone's width (ADR 0056), at 16 px below md as at 14 px. SelectField does this by its classes; this reaches
